      "value": "The old loading screen has been brought back in [VRChat 2026.1.3](https://docs.vrchat.com/docs/vrchat-202613) (March 31, 2026) for active VRC+ subscribers. The ability to pick between different loading screens was added in [VRChat 2026.1.3 (OPEN BETA)](https://docs.vrchat.com/docs/vrchat-202613-open-beta).\n\n(Duplicate feature request.)",
