  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2023-04-03T07:07:18.937Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "It would be really cool to see the old vrchat loading screen comeback, or at least an option to choose between the current loading screen and the old one. Recently vrchat has given us a lot of customization thanks to the new menu and HUD. It would be cool to customize the loading screen and even have an option to have the old space loading screen with the piano music and everything.",
